# Memory Bank

After each session reset, use the **source-of-truth baseline** plus targeted Memory Bank files—not the entire bank by default.

## Required baseline (every task)

1. **`docs/VSSYL_SOURCE_OF_TRUTH.md`**
2. **`memory-bank/activeContext.md`**
3. **`memory-bank/progress.md`**

## Expand by task (targeted reads only)

| Task | Also read |
|------|-----------|
| Module / feature | `memory-bank/*ProductContext.md`, `memory-bank/moduleSpecs.md` |
| Architecture / cross-cutting | `memory-bank/systemPatterns.md`, `memory-bank/designPatterns.md`, `memory-bank/techContext.md` |
| Database | `memory-bank/databaseContext.md` |
| Deploy / ops | `memory-bank/deployment.md`, `docs/deployment/` |
| Platform architecture detail | `docs/architecture/README.md` |

Do **not** read all 50+ Memory Bank files unless the user requests a full **update memory bank** refresh (then review all files; prioritize `activeContext.md` and `progress.md`).

## After major changes

Update Memory Bank status/progress as appropriate. Archive superseded docs per `docs/VSSYL_SOURCE_OF_TRUTH.md`.

## Where to write new documentation

**Placement policy:** `docs/guides/DOCUMENTATION_PLACEMENT.md` and `.cursor/rules/RULES_SUMMARY.md`.

- **Product intent / status** → `memory-bank/`
- **Agent rules** → `.cursor/rules/` (short)
- **Architecture** → `docs/architecture/`
- **How-to / onboarding** → `docs/guides/`

